Darkwood AI
===========

Copyright (c) 2026 Darkwood

Darkwood AI is an independently versioned PHP component repository for the
Darkwood ecosystem. It is not part of Symfony and does not depend on
symfony/ai-platform.

Inspiration
-----------

The Platform invocation shape (model catalog, model client, result converter,
deferred conversion, token usage) and the Jev (TypeSafe) bridge were adapted
from work originally prepared for Symfony AI:

    https://github.com/symfony/ai

Adapted files keep their original MIT license terms and Symfony copyright
notices (Copyright (c) Fabien Potencier). See those file headers and the
LICENSE file in src/Platform/Bridge/Jev/.

Newly authored Darkwood AI contracts are copyright Darkwood and licensed
under the repository MIT LICENSE.
